<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>User Research Portfolio</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

body {
    background: #f5f7fb;
    color: #1f2937;
}

header {
    background: #4f46e5;
    color: white;
    padding: 35px 8%;
}

header h1 {
    font-size: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

header p {
    font-size: 17px;
}

.container {
    width: 85%;
    margin: 30px auto;
}

.cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}

.card h2 {
    color: #4f46e5;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.number {
    font-size: 35px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.section {
    margin-top: 35px;
}

.section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
}

th, td {
    padding: 15px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    text-align: left;
}

th {
    background: #4f46e5;
    color: white;
}

.insights {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
}

.insight {
    background: white;
    padding: 20px;
    border-left: 5px solid #4f46e5;
    border-radius: 8px;
}

@media(max-width:700px) {
    .cards,
    .insights {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    header h1 {
        font-size: 28px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>User Research Portfolio</h1>
    <p>Understanding users, their needs and their problems</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

    <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Users Interviewed</h2>
            <div class="number">25</div>
            <p>Users participated in research</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Research Methods</h2>
            <div class="number">4</div>
            <p>Interview, Survey, Observation and Testing</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Key Insights</h2>
            <div class="number">12</div>
            <p>Important user insights discovered</p>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="section">

        <h2>Research Participants</h2>

        <table>

            <tr>
                <th>User</th>
                <th>Age</th>
                <th>Occupation</th>
                <th>Main Problem</th>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>User 01</td>
                <td>21</td>
                <td>Student</td>
                <td>Difficult navigation</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>User 02</td>
                <td>25</td>
                <td>Designer</td>
                <td>Complex interface</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>User 03</td>
                <td>30</td>
                <td>Developer</td>
                <td>Slow process</td>
            </tr>

        </table>

    </div>

    <div class="section">

        <h2>Key Research Insights</h2>

        <div class="insights">

            <div class="insight">
                <h3>Easy Navigation</h3>
                <p>Users prefer simple and clearly organized navigation.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="insight">
                <h3>Simple Design</h3>
                <p>Users find minimal interfaces easier to understand.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="insight">
                <h3>Fast Actions</h3>
                <p>Users want important actions to be completed quickly.</p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
